1. Prefix Increment (++c1)
2. Postfix Increment (c1++)
3. Add Two Complex Numbers
4. Compare Complex Numbers (<)
5. Exit
Enter your choice: 1
After prefix increment: 4 + 5i

Enter your choice: 3
Sum: 6 + 10i
```

