### 🧩 Quick recap
| Operator | Meaning | Example | Inside class |
|-----------|----------|----------|---------------|
| `operator++()` | Prefix increment | `++c1` | Member function |
| `operator++(int)` | Postfix increment | `c1++` | Member function |
| `operator+()` | Binary addition | `c3 = c1 + c2` | Member function |
| `operator<()` | Comparison | `if(c1 < c2)` | Member function |

